# Local dev working state — never committed. Layout and lifecycle tiers are
# documented inside each folder's own README; the size/free-space bound is
# `make check-dev-docs`, which `make gate` runs first. No tracked exception is
# carved out here: Zephyr's hand-authored harnesses already live in tracked
# scripts/ (gui-test.sh, perf-test.sh, baseline.sh), so nothing under these
# folders exists in exactly one unbacked copy.
/dev-docs/
/inbox/
